&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="4" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・GHG排出の&lt;br/&gt;　価格付け&lt;br/&gt;　進行&lt;br/&gt; &lt;br/&gt;・省エネ政策&lt;br/&gt;　の強化&lt;/p&gt;
